LICENSE TBD

This repository's code, dataset, and model licenses have not been finalized yet.

Before selecting a license, review:
- Upstream code/framework licenses (e.g., Piper, Coqui TTS, Transformers, phonemizer).
- Dataset/source permissions and consent for all audio and text.
- Trained model/checkpoint redistribution rights, including base model licenses.
- Whether code, datasets, and model weights should use separate licenses.

Until a license is added, no blanket permission is granted beyond what applicable law allows.
Contributors should not add third-party code, data, or model artifacts without compatible licensing and provenance.
